WEBVTT

00:01:55.503 --> 00:02:00.786
that the most destructive force
on the planet is humanity itself.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.224
We are in a point of history

00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:07.586
that no scientist could guarantee you
that you will survive this.

00:02:08.547 --> 00:02:11.146
We are in a point of history

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:14.882
that humanity is creating an environment

00:02:14.906 --> 00:02:18.258
that's not safe for humans anymore.

00:02:20.353 --> 00:02:21.950
Yeah, there I was,

00:02:22.878 --> 00:02:24.214
first year of geography,

00:02:24.238 --> 00:02:25.689
and felt pretty overwhelmed.

00:02:25.713 --> 00:02:26.879
But ...

00:02:27.329 --> 00:02:28.626
there was good news.